  "item_short_desc": "<p>Silence the storm with our Shadow Ops Waterproof Security Rain Jacket. Unlike the typical bulky rain coat that makes a lot of noise as you move, these high-performance, ultra-light rain jackets remain quiet, provide unparalleled wind and rain protection, and offer extreme comfort. The uniform jacket has a waterproof rating of 5,000mm that easily ensures harsh outdoor weather conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133410",
  "description": "<p>Silence the storm with our Shadow Ops Waterproof Security Rain Jacket. Unlike the typical bulky rain coat that makes a lot of noise as you move, these high-performance, ultra-light rain jackets remain quiet, provide unparalleled wind and rain protection, and offer extreme comfort. The uniform jacket has a waterproof rating of 5,000mm that easily ensures harsh outdoor weather conditions. Move with Silent Precision: Built to keep you comfortable and on-the move, our Active Flex stretch technology is ready to tackle any challenge, offering flexibility and ease of movement. From patrols to pursuits, these raincoats feature a sleek and silent design that utilizes our Shadow Ops fabric that is engineered with waterproof properties and a fabric that is quiet while you move. Duty Ready: The lightweight rain jacket features bold &ldquo;SECURITY&rdquo; lettering on the left chest and back for easy identification. Ensuring you remain dry and comfortable, the uniform rain jacket is great for security guards, public safety, bouncers, and more. Storage Pockets: The security jacket comes equipped with 2 zippered hand pockets and 2 interior drop pockets. Utility at the Forefront: These security raincoats feature a drawstring hood, full-length zipper with a snap-button storm placket, zipper storm guard, adjustable hook &amp; loop cuffs, and a drawstring bottom for keeping wind and rain out.</p>",
